# Google Maps Platform API Key for Vite client-side Maps JavaScript API
# Copy this file to .env.local and replace the placeholder with your key:
#   cp .env.example .env.local
#
# Quickstart (Free Zero-Billing Maps Demo Key for Prototyping):
#   1. Open https://mapsplatform.google.com/maps-demo-key?utm_campaign=gmp_git_agentsamples_v1.0.0
#   2. Sign in with any Google account (no billing card required)
#   3. Accept the Maps Demo Project Terms when prompted
#   4. Click to generate / reveal your Maps Demo Key
#   5. Paste the key below into .env.local (never commit .env.local!)
#
# Note: The Maps Demo Key has a daily reset limit and is for prototyping only.
# For production, create and restrict your own API key in Google Cloud Console:
#   https://console.cloud.google.com/google/maps-apis/credentials?utm_campaign=gmp_git_agentsamples_v1.0.0
# Enable: Maps JavaScript API, Places API (New), Routes API, Street View, Geocoding API.
VITE_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=your_google_maps_api_key_here
